    "会删除：这段时间的截图视频与索引、抽取出的观察和活动片段，以及 daily 时间线区块中的对应条目。daily 中区块外你手写的内容不受影响。与时间段有重叠的视频分段会整段删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes the screenshot videos and index for this period, the extracted observations and activity segments, and the matching entries in the daily timeline block. What you wrote outside the block in daily is not affected. Video segments that overlap the period are deleted entirely."
          }
